              <tr>\n                        <td>Cable Type</td>\n                        <td>Type-C to A(0.3m)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>General Information</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Output</td>\n                        <td>Output Interface:  USB3.1 Type-C</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Dimension</td>\n                        <td>127.5mm(L)*80mm(W)*14mm(H)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Efficiency (Approx.)</td>\n                        <td>Efficient Heat Dissipation</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Other Features</td>\n                        <td>Installation: Tool Free, Sliding Cover<br>\nTransparent PC + Aluminum Alloy<br>\nSupport up to 4TB SATA HDD SSD<br>\nUSB C to SATA3.0<br>\n5 Gbps transmission<br>\nTransparent 2.5-inch Enclosure<br>\nSupport UASP protocol<br>\nInstallation: Sliding Cover<br>\nSupported System: Windows/Mac/Linux</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Color</td>\n                        <td>Black</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                        <td>Material</td>\n                        <td>Transparent PC + Aluminum Alloy</td>\n                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                    </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2 style=\"text-align: justify; \"><b>ORICO 2179C3 2.5-Inch Transparent Aluminum External Hard Drive Enclosure</b></h2><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">The ORICO 2179C3 2.5-Inch Transparent Aluminum Black External <a href=\"/accessories/hdd-enclosure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hard Drive</a> Enclosure is a sleek and functional solution for expanding your storage capacity. Designed to accommodate both SATA HDDs and SSDs up to 4TB, this enclosure offers a convenient way to access and back up your data. Its transparent design, crafted from durable polycarbonate and aluminum alloy, not only adds a modern touch but also allows you to see the inner workings of your drive, creating an aesthetic appeal. Equipped with a USB 3.1 Type-C output interface, the ORICO 2179C3 provides high-speed data transfer rates of up to 5 Gbps, making it an excellent choice for quick file transfers and backups. Additionally, it supports the UASP protocol, which enhances performance by optimizing data transmission speeds, especially when using compatible devices. One of the standout features of this enclosure is its tool-free installation. The sliding cover design allows for easy access to your drive, enabling quick setup without the need for additional tools. Simply slide off the cover, insert your SATA drive, and secure it back in place. This user-friendly approach is perfect for both tech-savvy users and those new to external storage solutions. The ORICO 2179C3 is compatible with a wide range of operating systems, including Windows, macOS, and Linux, ensuring versatility across different platforms. Measuring 127.5mm in length, 80mm in width, and 14mm in height, it is compact enough to fit into any workspace or travel bag. Whether you need extra storage for work, media, or backups, the ORICO 2179C3 2.5-Inch Transparent Aluminum Black External Hard Drive Enclosure combines style, efficiency, and ease of use, making it an essential accessory for any digital lifestyle.</p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify; \"><b>Features of the ORICO 2179C3 Hard Drive Enclosure</b></h3><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify; \">Compatibility: Supports both SATA HDDs and SSDs up to 4TB, making it versatile for various storage needs.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">High-Speed Interface: Equipped with a USB 3.1 Type-C output, providing data transfer speeds of up to 5 Gbps for efficient file transfers.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">UASP Protocol Support: Enhances data transmission performance, particularly with compatible devices, improving overall speed and efficiency.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tool-Free Installation: Features a sliding cover design that allows for easy installation without the need for additional tools, simplifying the setup process.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Efficient Heat Dissipation: Designed with materials that promote effective heat dissipation, ensuring the longevity and reliability of your drives.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Durable Build: Made from a combination of transparent polycarbonate and aluminum alloy, offering both aesthetic appeal and durability.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Compact Dimensions: Measures 127.5mm in length, 80mm in width, and 14mm in height, making it portable and easy to fit in any workspace.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Broad OS Compatibility: Works with various operating systems, including Windows, macOS, and Linux, ensuring versatility across different devices.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Transparent Design: The clear housing provides a modern look while allowing users to view the internal components of the enclosure.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cable Included: Comes with a Type-C to Type-A cable (0.3m), facilitating immediate connection to a wide range of devices.</li></ul><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">These features make the ORICO 2179C3 an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable and stylish external hard drive enclosure.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-6 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-reviews\">\n                <form class=\"form-horizontal\" id=\"